# Mailbox placeholder

This directory is an agent's **outbox**: only what the *operator* must see —
decisions, blockers, deliverables, anomalies. Agent-to-agent messages go to the
peer's inbox, **never** here. See `reference/mailboxes.md` (at the team root).

Files are not tracked in this repo — each installed agent's mailbox is its own.
This `.gitkeep` only preserves the directory shape for the template.
